## 7. REST API & Controller Design

| Операция | Статус |
|----------|--------|
| GET (успех) | 200 OK |
| POST (создание) | 201 Created + `Location` |
| PUT/PATCH | 200 OK |
| DELETE | 204 No Content |
| Ошибка валидации | 400 Bad Request |
| Не найдено | 404 Not Found |
| Бизнес-конфликт | 409 Conflict |

- **Только records** для Request/Response
- Jakarta Bean Validation: `@Valid`, `@NotNull`, `@Size`, `@Email`
- Централизованный `@RestControllerAdvice`
- RFC 7807 `ProblemDetail` для ошибок

```java
@RestControllerAdvice
public class GlobalExceptionHandler {

    @ExceptionHandler(OrderNotFoundException.class)
    public ProblemDetail handleNotFound(OrderNotFoundException ex) {
        ProblemDetail pd = ProblemDetail.forStatusAndDetail(
            HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND, ex.getMessage());
        pd.setTitle("Order Not Found");
        return pd;
    }
}
```

